# Vercel CLI only honors .gitignore when no .vercelignore is present, but in
# practice local dev-server state under .expo/ (which can grow into a
# multi-hundred-MB log, as it did here) still got swept into the upload and
# blew past Vercel's 100MB single-file limit. Explicit list, not a fallback.
node_modules/
.expo/
.git/
dist/
web-build/
design/
supabase/
